WEBVTT

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:08.310
<i>The trio of Kikuchi, Nagata, and Hagio</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:12.110
<i>have been sent to the Hateruma Office.</i>

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:15.610
<b>Meeting Room 3</b>

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.610
<i>And as sure as people will leave, 
there are others who will come along.</i>

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.620
Well, it's time for introductions.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:22.210
These are the new members of 
our team: Tsukui, the temp,

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.210
<i>Agenda 19
<b></b></i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\hNewcomers

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:25.110
and Yaotome, who left his 
last position to join Teiai.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.380
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.290
We should have one other new hire,

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.330
but it seems orientation is running long...

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:36.390
Ah, perfect timing. Come on in.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.390
Pardon me.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.140
<b>Psst...Psst...Psst...</b>

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.020
I apologize for being late.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.660
I've been assigned to Team Tonegawa,

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.750
and my name is Nishiguchi Saeko.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:54.030
It's a pleasure to be working with you.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.130
<i>A woman in black?!</i>

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:57.950
<b>Psst...</b>

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.050
<i>Nishiguchi Saeko.</i>

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.720
<i>The woman in black arrives with an impact!</i>

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.960
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:15.050
<b>Middle Management Blues</b>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:15.050
<b><i>Mr. Tonegawa</i></b>

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:42.320
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.510
Hey, enough! Stop with the whispering!

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:43.210
<i>Psst...</i>

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:46.900
I know women at Teiai don't usually 
end up working among the black suits,

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.640
so I can understand your surprise...

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.650
But once you're an employee here, 
your gender isn't a factor.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.610
You understand that, right, Nishiguchi?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.150
Yes, sir.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.440
I understand that women in 
black are rare here at Teiai,

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.410
but I'll work my hardest, 
whatever the task.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:04.910
<b>And yet...</b>

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.910
<i>And yet...</i>

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.880
I've never met a woman in black before.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.940
Hey, Saeko-chan, what do you do on weekends?

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:11.650
Excuse me?

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.920
Hey! No prying into private matters.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:19.170
One wrong move, and it 
becomes sexual harassment!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.170
<b>Sexual Harassment</b>

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.260
Just from asking about her days off?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.430
Let me ask you this, then.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.930
Does that question have anything 
to do with your jobs?!

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:28.930
That's...

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:32.230
If the person on the receiving end feels 
it's sexual harassment, it's sexual harassment!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.130
That's where the line is 
drawn in the sand nowadays.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.520
I don't particularly min—

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.940
And another thing!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.200
<b>"chan"</b>

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.200
None of this "-chan" business!

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.960
You can't get too familiar 
just because she's a woman.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.950
Th-That's... pretty strict.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.040
Nishiguchi-san, about these papers...

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.830
Sexual harassment!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.750
You smell really nice, Nishiguchi-san.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.210
Sexual harassment!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:03:59.930
Sexual harassment!

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:00.970
S-Sorry!

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:07.600
Sexual harassment! Sexual harassment!
Sexual harassment!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.920
<i>The addition of a woman in black to the team</i>

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.600
<i>did cause an initial bit 
of turbulence, but...</i>

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.600
<b>Meeting Room 3</b>

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.100
What's that smell?

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.620
It smells pretty good...

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.110
What's this?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.310
It's aromatic incense.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.530
Incense?

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:26.320
The scent of peppermint is 
supposed to increase focus.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.200
If you don't like it, I can...

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:29.740
No.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:34.630
The stagnant smell of the meeting 
room was starting to get to me.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:36.250
This does the trick.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.750
<i>And after that...</i>

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.750
<b>And after that...</b>

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.310
Here you go.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.700
Something to wake you up.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.010
Oh, thanks!

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.510
I made this myself.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.140
Please, help yourselves.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.080
It's a banana and sour cream cake.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.530
Oh, your button came off.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.280
Here you are.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.280
I appreciate it.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:06.280
<i>Despite themselves, the men in black find 
themselves focused on Nishiguchi Saeko.</i>

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.780
<i>However!</i>

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.780
<b>However!</b>

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:12.290
Click-clack...

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.580
Nishiguchi-san is such a sweetheart.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.290
She's seriously great.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.960
Plus, she's pretty cute!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.120
Huh? Nakata, don't tell me...

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.570
Whoa, no, no, no!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:19.670
You're not ready for girls!

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.670
<i>They're all acting so goofy.</i>

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.920
<i>The next day...</i>

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.020
Ouch...

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.830
Is something wrong, Saemon-saburou-san?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.140
Nishiguchi-san?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.760
Saemon is fine, by the way.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:35.270
Okay...

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.770
Just a bit of a blister from my shoe.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.820
I'm fine, really.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.690
That's terrible!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.530
You can use this bandage, if you like.

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.780
