00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.170
I'll run and grab some slippers!

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.790
Th-Thanks...

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.050
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:14.930
<i>A notification from Face Album?</i>

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.440
Suggestions                      Barcode

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.440
You might know...

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.440
View All

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.440
Add Friend

