<i>Wait, "Saeko Nishiguchi" as in...</i>

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.230
<i>No way... Nishiguchi-san?!</i>

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.570
Celebrating my new job with some latte art <3

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.570
<i>It </i>is<i> her!</i>

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:32.070
<i>I kinda feel like I shouldn't 
be looking at this...</i>

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.330
<b>Ba-dump...</b>

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.850
At the gym pool with my BF Miki!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.830
<i>A swimsuit?!</i>

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.710
<i>Bikini... Bikini... Bikini...</i>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.130
<i>Now arriving at Nishi-Ogikubo.</i>

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:45.340
<i>That was a shock.</i>

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.230
<i>She must be pretty active on her days off.</i>

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.840
Oh? Saemon-saburou-san?

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.180
Huh?

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.130
Nishiguchi-san?!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.350
<b>Ba-dump...</b>

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.400
W-Well, you... must use 
this station, too, huh?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.800
Yes. You, too?

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.180
Y-Yeah... And you can call me Saemon.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:07.110
<i>Omit the "Saburou"!</i>

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.860
<b>Saemon-saburou</b>

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.110
<b>Saemon</b>

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:11.260
Okay, then, Saemon-san. 
Quite the coincidence, huh?

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.440
I-I guess so.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:17.490
<b>Ba-dump... Ba-dump... Ba-dump...</b>

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.490
Oh, is your blister still bothering you?

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.430
Oh, no... Thankfully, it's not too bad.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:24.000
Really? That's great.

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:38.270
<b>Ba-dump... Ba-dump... Ba-dump...</b>

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.770
Well, I'm headed this way.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:42.180
If you'll excuse me.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:48.150
Uh... er... um...

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:48.150
<b>Ba-dump... Ba-dump...Ba-dump...</b>

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.760
Shall I walk you home?!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.640
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:56.930
Huh?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.660
<i>The words slip out unconsciously!</i>

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.870
<b>Slipped Out!!</b>

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.660
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.440
Er, uh... I mean...

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:08.930
I-It's not always safe to 
