00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.490
Oh...

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:15.550
I appreciate the offer, 
but I'll be fine. It's not far.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.430
I... I see...

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:22.210
I'll be seeing you.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.690
R-Right. Tomorrow, then.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.560
<i>Why the hell did I say that?!</i>

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:37.700
<i>That was like a stock line from some creep 
