00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.920
<i>I hope she didn't take it the wrong way...</i>

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:45.350
<i>He is consumed by a 
swell of coursing regret!</i>

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.460
<b>A Swell of Regret</b>

