00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.850
<b>Hiro-kun</b>

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.860
<i>H-Hiro-kun?!</i>

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.860
S-Sorry! I'll be right back!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:17.240
<i>For Nishiguchi-san to blush like that...</i>

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:19.980
Saemon?

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:23.620
Bathroom... be... right back...

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.360
What am I so surprised about?

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:39.140
Of course she'd have one. 
Why wouldn't she?

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:43.060
She's bound to have a boyfriend, at least.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.640
<b>She's bound to have a boyfriend, at least.</b>

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:50.420
<i>Saemon experiences a minor heartbreak...</i>

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.650
<b>Saemon experiences a minor heartbreak...</b>

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.330
I mean, so what?

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.400
It's not like it matters to me...

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.400
Not to me!

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.160
Would you come off it?!

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:08.120
How many times do I gotta tell 
ye not to call me at work?!

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.040
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.960
And I keep tellin' ye,

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:15.050
don't send so many dang strawberries! 
They're just in the way!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.510
Honestly...

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.720
Strawberries?

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.730
Look, I gotta get back to 
work, so I'm hangin' up,

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:21.930
Onii-chan!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.260
<b>Onii-chan</b>

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.890
Onii-chan?!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:30.230
Onii-chan

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:27.980
Onii-chan

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.230
Onii-chan

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:33.770
Oh, for pity's sake, 
would you give it a rest?!

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.780
Huh... Then that means...

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.780
<b>Huh...</b>

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.780
<b>Then that means...</b>

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:41.160
<b>Hiro-kun ≠ boyfriend</b>

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:41.160
<b>-> Brother</b>

