I had the wrong idea! 
I jumped to conclusions!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.160
<b>-> Blood relative</b>

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:44.520
Oh, enough! I've had enough of you!

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.890
But more important than that...

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:47.160
Are you gonna make me 
repeat myself even more?!

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:47.160
I can't believe it... Nishiguchi-san...

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.820
has a Hakata accent,

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:56.800
<b>Hakata Girl</b>

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:51.350
and she's a little sister type!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:56.800
<b>Little Sister Type</b>

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.080
<i>She even has a flip phone!</i>

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.810
