00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:01.800
I have too many,
so help yourself.
-Nishiguchi

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.610
<i>And with the arrival of 
strawberries, spring is here.</i>

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.800
<b>And with the arrival of 
strawberries, spring is here.</b>

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.800
<b>Smoking Room</b>

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:03.800
