00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.640
S-Sorry! I'll be right back!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:20.770
<i>Another man suffers heartbreak in secret.</i>

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:26.020
Onii-chan! You hear me?

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:32.680
<i>Today, President Hyoudou and Tonegawa 
have their monthly dinner meeting.</i>

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:39.270
Well, how about a toast, Tonegawa?

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:39.720
Of course.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:45.370
You know, I've actually been visiting 
an English conversation school lately.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.030
Have you, sir?

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:47.930
Indeed.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.550
How's that?

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.410
Excellent! That was wonderful, sir!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.360
Isn't it, though?

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.250
I'd expect nothing less from you, sir.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:15.000
<i>Huh?! Isn't that...</i>

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.610
<i>Yaotome?</i>

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.250
Too good...

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:23.090
Hey! What are you doing?!
