Sir, please stop!

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:14.940
I might just fall for you if you keep going!

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:17.940
Tonegawa.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:18.940
Sir?

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:28.340
<i>And so Yaotome Ataru, the MIB from 
another company, ingratiates himself</i>

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.200
<i>with the president immediately.</i>

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.700
<b>Meeting Room 3</b>

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.830
Tonegawa-sensei, here's your tea.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.610
Ah, thank you, Nishiguchi.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:39.780
