00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:42.500
Mr. President?! Right away, sir!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.590
Excuse me! I need to head out for a bit!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.030
He's rather impressive.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.290
Yeah...

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.990
I heard a rumor

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:58.900
that Yaotome-san used to be a pro salesman 
who worked in a variety of fields.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.650
In particular, when he was 
selling fiber-optic services,

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:06.000
the nickname he got from 
sealing deals so quickly

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:08.400
