00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.380
<b>light</b>

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.660
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:13.050
Well, that might have been enough in sales,

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:16.910
but that kind of sycophantic 
nonsense won't help here at Teiai.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.090
<i>And yet...</i>

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.960
Everyone's here, right?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.420
First, about the documents 
I sent you earlier...

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:30.550
Is Yaotome here?

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.810
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:36.570
What's the matter, Mr. President?

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.120
Oh, Yaotome.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:40.840
Mr. President!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:45.440
Your kingly aura is too strong! 
Please, show some restraint!

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.660
That's right, bow down!

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.450
Uh... Sir...

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.440
What is it, Tonegawa?

00:14:56.440 --> 00:15:00.210
Don't mind me. Continue your meeting.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.080
R-Right...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.660
Oh, by the way, I've gotten into 
making noodles for soba lately.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.500
That is so cool!

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:10.570
Well, let's resume the meeting—

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.390
You're saying... I can eat 
soba that <i>you</i> made?

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.240
Yes.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.620
I'm so blessed! Blessed beyond belief!

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.250
<b>Blessed!!</b>

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:21.330
I-I'm sorry, sir...

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:25.110
I have to do a little dance!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.420
You're that pleased, are you?

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:30.430
Yay! Yay! The president's soba!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.610
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:34.390
Yay! Yay! The president's soba!

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:47.210
<i>And as a consequence, Tonegawa is 
summoned by the president less and less.</i>

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:47.210
<b>Decrease...!!</b>

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:51.260
Well, this actually makes 
things easier for me.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.310
<i>But then, a few days later...</i>

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:57.800
Oh, good morning!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.720
<b>Psst...</b>

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:03.140
Yaotome,  what... are you wearing?

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.480
Hey, we match!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.510
Y-You...

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:10.730
Well, the president said it was hard to 
tell me apart from the other men in black,

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.360
so I decided to change my look and went...

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.450
to Ginza and Marunouchi!

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:19.830
But I have to say, you really are 
Teiai's resident fashionista.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.810
You were able to see the direction 
that the trends were going in

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:26.670
and can pull off the two-piece suit with 
ease, using your mature sensibility!

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:29.290
<i>And around that time, 
rumors begin to surface...</i>

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:40.280
Whisper... Whisper...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:33.050
Is it me or is President Hyoudou 
always with Yaotome lately?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:36.680
I hear he introduced him as his 
right-hand man at a meeting.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.480
But isn't Tonegawa-sensei 
supposed to be number two?

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:41.430
But for how long?

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:48.290
<i>Rumors of Yaotome being the front-runner 
to become the next number two man at Teiai.</i>

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:51.130
<i>It's ridiculous! That would never happen!</i>

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:54.850
<i>Some ship-jumping man in black from 
who knows where, as number two?</i>

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:58.460
<i>It's them... again...</i>

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:00.310
Your blood type, sir?

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:01.950
Yeah. Go on and guess.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:04.020
Let's see...

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:04.660
<b>King</b>

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.210
Well since "oh" means king, 
maybe you're type O!

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:08.840
Exactly!

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:09.160
I knew it!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.460
P-President!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.400
I-It's good to see you again, sir.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:17.130
Right...

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:22.410
I've made reservations at one of my 
favorite places for our next dinner meeting.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:25.850
I'm sure you'll be pleased 
with what they have to offer.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.420
O-Oh, I see...

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:30.110
Uh...

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.360
<b>Psst...</b>

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.110
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.070
Oh, right. Tonegawa.

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.410
Yaotome, where are you from again?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.140
Sendai, sir.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.490
<i>P-President...</i>

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:49.880
<i>He almost forgot my name!</i>

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.880
<i>And then, the day arrives...</i>

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:57.380
<i>The dinner meeting with Tonegawa's 
position on the line!</i>

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:01.010
Yaotome, guess what my favorite food is.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.140
Well, let's see...

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.630
<i>Why the hell is he even here?!</i>

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.950
I think it might be...

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.300
<i>But it's fine. I still 
have an ace up my sleeve.</i>

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.570
President...

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:18.290
Oh, my! That's quite the view.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.370
I thought the sight of the commoners 
and their pitiful struggles

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.200
would go well with your wine.

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:29.580
Look at them, practically squirming...

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.620
<i>It's a moment of bliss for Hyoudou</i>

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.620
<i>and Tonegawa's moment of redemption.</i>

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:39.490
This place is quite nice.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.820
I'm glad you—

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.470
Move aside, Yaotome!

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:50.280
You're blocking his view!

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.270
I won't!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.330
I won't move, no matter what!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.280
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:59.410
Come on now, move!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.530
Over here... or so it seems, but it was a feint.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.040
I'll punish you!

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.290
Get on the iron plate!

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.130
Iron plate?

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.040
<b>Roasting Kneeling</b>

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.370
I won't! If anyone should...

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.800
It's you, Mr. President!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.550
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.930
Because... it's so cruel...

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.390
<b>Psst... Psst... Psst...</b>

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.960
You've just been staring at the view

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:39.550
and not paying any attention to me!

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.620
Wh-What kind of crazy talk are you—

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.530
It's not crazy!

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:49.950
Isn't it natural that the citizens would 
seek the affection of their king?!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:53.380
Especially when it's a titan 
like President Hyoudou?!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:56.840
How could I deny my desire to 
please such an absolute ruler

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.800
who is overflowing with charisma?!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:03.430
The president doesn't understand 
how devastatingly incredible he is!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:08.810
He's a superstar to me!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.480
My idol! My ideal! A god!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.560
The center of the universe! 
A cosmic singularity!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.750
<i>He's unstoppable!</i>

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:21.070
<i>Nothing can give him pause, and he gives 
no opportunity for anyone to break in!</i>

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:24.650
He's the very concept itself! He embodies 
the fundamental nature of presidency!

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:27.280
<i>It's a endless flood of praise!</i>

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.450
<i>Yaotome, the drummer boy!</i>

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.450
<b>Yaotome, the drummer boy!</b>

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.890
<i>And he is wrecking it with a drum solo!</i>

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:39.710
<b>And he is wrecking it</b>

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.710
<b>with a drum solo!</b>

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.490
You're forgiven!

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.720
<b>Forgiven</b>

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:56.810
<i>Yaotome receives an unprecedented 
promotion to the president's secretary!</i>

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:00.290
<i>An unexpected rival has 
appeared for Tonegawa.</i>

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:04.630
<i>But hang in there, Tonegawa! 
Don't give up, Tonegawa!</i>

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:09.930
<i>This is the story of a lone man who 
struggles between his employer,</i>

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:14.080
<i>the president, and his own 
employees, the men in black...</i>

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:18.150
<i>Tonegawa Yukio: Middle Manager!</i>

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:57.160
Next time, "Entertaining."

00:22:56.080 --> 00:23:00.250
<b>Entertaining</b>
